WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.031
SIMU LIU
I never thought in my wildest dreams

00:00:02.082 --> 00:00:03.273
that I would be here.

00:00:06.547 --> 00:00:09.513
When they announced this movie
I was like really, really excited.

00:00:09.563 --> 00:00:11.645
Kind of tongue-in-cheek
I ended up tweeting Marvel,

00:00:11.695 --> 00:00:14.744
"Hey, we gonna talk or what?"
So, I'm very glad I did that.

00:00:14.795 --> 00:00:16.795
KEVIN FEIGE
Shang-Chi and the Legend of The Ten Rings!

00:00:21.713 --> 00:00:23.186
SIMU LIU
We shot this film in Sydney

00:00:23.236 --> 00:00:25.354
over the course
of like, 13 months.

00:00:32.002 --> 00:00:33.654
Some days I work out
harder than others.

00:00:37.921 --> 00:00:39.702
This is every kid's dream.

00:00:44.874 --> 00:00:46.694
A couple of people to say hi to.

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:51.035
It totally was a whirlwind
experience going from city to city...

00:00:56.278 --> 00:00:58.278
Seeing the way
that the fans responded.

00:01:02.963 --> 00:01:05.702
It was such an incredible
moment for all of us.

00:01:06.252 --> 00:01:07.663
This is only the beginning.

00:01:07.947 --> 00:01:10.482
SHANG-CHI
It's time to show them who I really am.

